  musl-patched-green-20260928b: expanded numerical controls all pass.
  musl-patched-final-20260928: final link/identity-audited 192/192 PASS.

Recipe (output must not already exist):
  python3 tools/ladder/musl_patched.py --evocc target/frontend/debug/evocc \
    --output .build/floating-targeted/musl-patched-NEW
Use --unpatched-control for the deliberately failing original-archive control.
